# ===== Backend connection =====
# URL of the NestJS backend (WebSocket + HTTP).
# In Docker Compose this is typically http://localhost:3000
# In production replace with your deployed backend URL.
VITE_WS_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Backend REST API URL (for Machine Designer CRUD).
# Defaults to http://localhost:3000 if not set.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
